			    	<div class="content">
			    	                                <h3 class="columnTitle">Atlantic Cape Buccaneers</h3>
                                                <p>Think you have what it takes to become an Atlantic Cape Buccaneer student-athlete? Complete our Athletics Interest Form to get started today. Our Athletics department, in conjunction with AtlantiCare, provides free physicals before the start of the Fall and Spring semesters for all prospective/returning athletes.</p>
<p>All required documentation can be submitted via email to the Athletics Department, delivered in person, or mailed. Detailed information on all the forms you will need and where to send them may be found on the Information for Student-Athletes page.</p>
